{"type":"message","id":"223ec2aa","parentId":"40cb311b","timestamp":"2026-07-28T06:40:16.017Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Looking at the data from this run, I can explain why the card doesn't include the running cost:\n\n## What the Token Aggregation Shows\n\nThe `aggregate_run_tokens.py` output shows:\n- **All tokens_in = 0, tokens_out = 0, tokens_total = 0**\n- **cost_usd = 0.0**\n- **by_model** shows only `pollinations/flux` (image model) with `priced: false`\n\nThis indicates that the **underlying model APIs are returning zero token counts** in their responses. The models used (like `zai.glm-5`, `qwen.qwen3-coder-next`, `minimax.minimax-m2.5`) are either:\n1. Not exposing token usage in their API responses, or\n2. Being routed through a proxy/gateway that strips token metadata, or\n3. Are free-tier models that don't bill per-token\n\n## Why the Card Shows No Cost\n\nThe `build_and_send_card.py` reads from `$RUN_DIR/publish/tokens.json` (written by `aggregate_run_tokens.py`). Since that file contains:\n```json\n{\n  \"tokens_total\": 0,\n  \"cost_usd\": 0.0,\n  \"by_model\": {...}\n}\n```\n\nThe card builder correctly propagates these zeros to the card — there's no meaningful cost data to display.\n\n## Root Cause\n\nThe issue is **upstream at the model provider level**, not in the pipeline code. The token-counting logic in `aggregate_run_tokens.py` works correctly, but it can only aggregate what the API responses contain. If Bedrock/gateway models don't return `usage.input_tokens` / `usage.output_tokens` fields, the aggregation will always show zero.\n\nYou would need to check:\n1. Whether your Bedrock/gateway configuration exposes token usage in responses\n2. Whether `sessions_spawn` (subagent runtime) captures and surfaces token metadata from child completions"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bedrock-mantle","model":"zai.glm-5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1785220807621,"responseId":"chatcmpl-9ba8c559-c0af-4400-9820-710b4e13ceab"}}
